// Ability definitions.
// Loaded at coordinator startup via AbilityRegistry::load_abilities().
// Edit this file to tune damage, cooldowns, and hitbox shapes without recompiling.
//
// Optional ability fields (all default to 0 / false / None if omitted):
//   ability_id                   — must be unique; matched by UseAbility intent and CooldownExpire
//   base_damage                  — raw damage before any multipliers
//   damage_type                  — Physical | Magical | True
//   shape                        — Sphere | Cone | CapsuleSweep | Projectile | LineSweep | HazardZone
//   threat_multiplier            — 1.0 = threat equals damage dealt
//   on_hit_buffs                 — list of buff IDs applied to target on each hit (default: [])
//   knockback_force              — impulse magnitude away from attacker on hit (default: 0.0)
//   allow_reentry                — true = target can be hit again after leaving hitbox (default: false)
//   require_grounded             — true = player must be grounded to cast; false = air-cast allowed (default: true)
//   charge_tiers                 — list of (min_ticks, damage_mult) for hold-to-release abilities (default: None)
//   charge_roots_while_charging  — false = caster may move freely during charge (default: true)
//   damage_interval_ticks        — periodic re-damage interval in ticks; 0 = single-hit (default: 0)
//   pierce                       — true = projectile passes through all targets (default: false)
//   pull_force                   — pull impulse toward attacker on hit (default: 0.0)
//   launch_lift                  — upward launch lift + FLOATING arc (default: 0.0)
//   launch_recovery_ticks        — KNOCKED_DOWN recovery ticks after launch landing (default: 0)
//   stun_ticks                   — stun duration in ticks; applied on landing if combined with arc CC (default: 0)
//   knockdown_ticks              — knockdown duration in ticks; applied on landing if combined with arc CC (default: 0)
//   targeting_mode               — DirectionTarget (default) | EntityTarget | GroundTarget | RaycastStrict | AimAssist | LockOn(max_targets: N) | SelfOnly | CasterOffset
//   cast_facing_policy           — PreserveBody (default) | FaceAimDirection | FaceResolvedTarget
//   projectile_speed             — units per tick; None = default 1.0 (20 units/sec at 20 Hz)
//   max_range                    — max range in units; None = default 30.0
//   target_filter                — Hostile (default) | Friendly | All — team-based hit filtering
//
// Timeline actions (tick_offset is relative to cast tick):
//   SpawnHitbox(shape, offset)             — logical hitbox; no Rapier sensor until ApplyDamageFrame
//   SpawnConfiguredHitbox(shape, offset, effect, rules)
//                                          — logical hitbox with per-hitbox override payloads
//   ApplyDamageFrame                       — materialise sensor; contacts this tick deal damage
//   RemoveHitbox                           — despawn sensor, clear hitbox record
//   CooldownStart(duration_ticks)          — start cooldown; 20 ticks = 1 second at 20 Hz
//   OpenFollowUpWindow(duration_ticks, id) — combo window: next press of same ability casts id
//   ApplyBuff(buff_id)                     — self-buff from BuffRegistry template
//   StanceBegin(dodge_active, rooted)      — iframe window and/or root; rooted + airborne injects fall arc
//   StanceEnd                              — end iframe, clear root; preserves gravity-only fall arcs
//   ArcMovement(speed, lift, gravity)      — kinematic vault/leap; entity rooted during arc
//   RootForTicks(ticks)                    — timed root composable with other root sources
//   SetMovement(movement)                  — Free | InputLocked | Rooted
//   Telegraph(impact_delay)               — emit TelegraphWarning to resolved target entities
//
// Per-hitbox effects/rules:
//   effect: Some((base_damage, damage_type, threat_multiplier, ...))
//       overrides damage, on-hit buffs, knockback/pull/launch, and timed CC for this hitbox.
//       Use effect: None to copy the ability's default hit effect into the active hitbox.
//       IMPORTANT: effect: Some(...) is a full replacement payload, not a patch.
//       Fields omitted inside Some(...) default to zero/false/[] and do NOT inherit
//       from the top-level ability. If you want the default hit plus one change,
//       you must currently repeat the other non-default hit fields here.
//   rules: Some((allow_reentry, damage_interval_ticks, pierce, max_rewind_ticks, target_filter))
//       overrides reentry, periodic damage, projectile pierce, rewind cap, and team filter.
//       Use rules: None to copy the ability's default hitbox rules.
//       IMPORTANT: rules: Some(...) is also a replacement payload; omitted fields
//       default rather than inheriting from the ability.
//   effect.on_contact may queue secondary hitboxes on successful contact:
//       SpawnHitbox(delay_ticks, duration_ticks, shape, offset, effect, rules)
(
    abilities: [
        (
            ability_id: 1,
            name: "Slash",
            base_damage: 25.0,
            damage_type: Physical,
            shape: CapsuleSweep,
            threat_multiplier: 1.0,
            targeting_mode: DirectionTarget,
            cast_facing_policy: FaceAimDirection,
